Package: zukomptest
Title: Proves zukomp's Extensibility from Outside
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A deliberately minimal consumer of zukomp, existing only to
    prove from outside the package that the codec registry is genuinely
    extensible: it registers its own codec through the published C ABI and
    expects it to behave like a built-in one, limits included. Not
    distributed; built and run by CI.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: 
    zukomp
LinkingTo: 
    zukomp
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.2.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
